  "description": "RIQDED crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C116 H88 N8 O20 Y4,2(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Y1 (Y) has 6 O neighbors; Y2 (Y) has 7 O neighbors; Y3 (Y) has 6 O neighbors; Y4 (Y) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.792-3.838 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 105.78-108.59°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C120H94N10O20Y4. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
